    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world with breakbeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, he is a superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in his true form, he is an up-and-coming DJ who keeps the clubs lively night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His name is BrebeMan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, he plays breakbeats from two records and defends the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he never misses to proselytize breakbeat sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish this game, you will be hooked on breakbeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the true music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BrebeMan&quot; is a 3D SHMUPS &amp; music game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the superhero \u201cBrebeMan\u201d and defeat the enemy \u201cKlangeist\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disc manipulated by BrebeMan is an offensive and defensive tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times it is a blade that slices the enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at other times it is a shield that protects you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you accumulate tension, you can &quot;change the beat&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Change the Beat&quot; attacks all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss awaits you at the end of each stage. Face them with all your might.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music features a wide variety of club music styles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from classic to trendy, with drum'n'bass as the mainstay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sounds that progress according to the game enhance the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with BrebeMan , various characters are represented in the collage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage, vaporwave, retro-futuristic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and various other visuals invite you into an unknown world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save the world with breakbeats.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the surface, he is a superhero. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But in his true form, he is an up-and-coming DJ who keeps the clubs lively night after night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >His name is BrebeMan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, he plays breakbeats from two records and defends the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, he never misses to proselytize breakbeat sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you finish this game, you will be hooked on breakbeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the true music game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;BrebeMan&quot; is a 3D SHMUPS &amp; music game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control the superhero \u201cBrebeMan\u201d and defeat the enemy \u201cKlangeist\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURING</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disc manipulated by BrebeMan is an offensive and defensive tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times it is a blade that slices the enemy, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and at other times it is a shield that protects you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you accumulate tension, you can &quot;change the beat&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Change the Beat&quot; attacks all enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful boss awaits you at the end of each stage. Face them with all your might.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music features a wide variety of club music styles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >from classic to trendy, with drum'n'bass as the mainstay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive sounds that progress according to the game enhance the game.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with BrebeMan , various characters are represented in the collage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintage, vaporwave, retro-futuristic,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and various other visuals invite you into an unknown world.</p></li></ul>",
